{"id":"burg","lemma":"Burg","pos":"noun","rank":3492,"glosses":["castle, fortification","beaver lodge","sandcastle"],"ipa":"/bʊʁk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/fe/De-Burg.ogg/De-Burg.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Burg","plural":"Burgen"},"examples":[{"text":"Mein Heim ist meine Burg.","en":"My home is my castle.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"home, to the house"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null]},{"text":"Die Burg ist einen Besuch wert.","en":"The castle is worth visiting.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"visit, call"},{"g":"worth, worthy of"}]},{"text":"Diese Burg ist über tausend Jahre alt.","en":"This castle is over a thousand years old.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"thousand"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"old"}]},{"text":"Leute rannten aus der Burg.","en":"People ran out of the castle.","words":[{"g":"people"},{"g":"race","l":"Rennen"},{"g":"out of / from"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Vor vielen Jahren gab es hier eine Burg.","en":"There was a castle here many years ago.","words":[{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}